{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803120/extras/8ea36f3eab8e3546aeb6da715b4ff9b7.avif?t=1753538871\" alt=\"What is DWARRF: A Pinball Roguelike?\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Pinball/Pachinko/Bubble Shooter mashup roguelike where you play as a 'pirate' dwarf who must adventure alone into the depths of the mines. Slay enemies in a unique 2-phase combat system equipped with a variety of balls and relics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With this demo you can explore the first floor of DWARRF: A Pinball Roguelike: &quot;The Mines&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803120/extras/444e8604a82cb67b497d8d65bbf92607.avif?t=1753538871\" alt=\"Power up your balls in the mining phase\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803120/extras/ca6eae9f182b448525c0befbdcf434c1.poster.avif?t=1753538871\" aria-label=\"A chaotic mining phase (pinball/pachinko)\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803120/extras/ca6eae9f182b448525c0befbdcf434c1.webm?t=1753538871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803120/extras/ca6eae9f182b448525c0befbdcf434c1.mp4?t=1753538871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Firstly, you must launch your ball into the mine-shaft, hitting pegs and bumpers alike to power up your ball. Striking at ores will generate 'frenzy', further increasing your potential damage. Use your flippers to keep the ball in play and look out for unique objects on the board, such as extra cannons or a wyverns head that'll bite down on your cannonball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803120/extras/0d9c861081f771fcfb396bb946293c41.avif?t=1753538871\" alt=\"Destroy the incoming hoarde in the battle phase\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803120/extras/cfac470b822f69a3a95e0a4520fbf929.poster.avif?t=1753538871\" aria-label=\"Fighting the necromancer in the battle phase\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803120/extras/cfac470b822f69a3a95e0a4520fbf929.webm?t=1753538871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803120/extras/cfac470b822f69a3a95e0a4520fbf929.mp4?t=1753538871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you've powered up your ball, unleash it onto the battlefield and wreak havoc. Balls have unique traits that can help in a fight - such as multiball, explosions, and area of effects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This Demo contains:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 balls to try out in both the mining &amp; battle phases.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">13 game altering relics to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Themed pinball boards based on your enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random event &amp; chest encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A new &amp; handy tutorial to help guide you through this new genre fusion!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controller support, rebindable keyboard &amp; mouse controls, &amp; QoL features already!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Expect regular updates to this demo throughout development of DWARRF: A Pinball Roguelike</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3803120?t=1753538871","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3803120?t=1753538871","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803120/1cd78eea2247ce46d826e1cf633bbb60309acbc6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753538871","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803120/1cd78eea2247ce46d826e1cf633bbb60309acbc6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753538871","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803120/extras/8ea36f3eab8e3546aeb6da715b4ff9b7.avif?t=1753538871\" alt=\"What is DWARRF: A Pinball Roguelike?\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Pinball/Pachinko/Bubble Shooter mashup roguelike where you play as a 'pirate' dwarf who must adventure alone into the depths of the mines. Slay enemies in a unique 2-phase combat system equipped with a variety of balls and relics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With this demo you can explore the first floor of DWARRF: A Pinball Roguelike: &quot;The Mines&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803120/extras/444e8604a82cb67b497d8d65bbf92607.avif?t=1753538871\" alt=\"Power up your balls in the mining phase\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_p