mp4?t=1753538871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you've powered up your ball, unleash it onto the battlefield and wreak havoc. Balls have unique traits that can help in a fight - such as multiball, explosions, and area of effects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This Demo contains:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 balls to try out in both the mining &amp; battle phases.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">13 game altering relics to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Themed pinball boards based on your enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random event &amp; chest encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A new &amp; handy tutorial to help guide you through this new genre fusion!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controller support, rebindable keyboard &amp; mouse controls, &amp; QoL features already!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Expect regular updates to this demo throughout development of DWARRF: A Pinball Roguelike</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>","developers":["YETIBYTES"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3634710","name":"DWARRF: A Pinball Roguelike"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803120/3aea7a8a674fab1730d3641127294a2b5df21d0d/header.jpg?t=1753538871","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257172750,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172750/movie480.mp4?t=1753538869","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172750/movie_max.mp4?t=1753538869"},"name":"GameplayTrailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257172750/8288099aecda3eda0a07ab1a864088e620f474c4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753538869","webm":{"